Package: com.rocketkid300.veiled
Name: Veiled
Description: Hide any app from your Home Screen. Long-press an app and pick "Add to Veiled" and its icon disappears from the Home Screen and App Library. Hidden apps live inside the Veiled app, which is disguised as a working Calculator: type your passcode and press = to get in. The tweak shows nothing on screen except an optional low-battery reminder to re-jailbreak, and closes hidden apps a few seconds after the phone locks.
